WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.257
We give the assistant a purpose, audience, context, task, constraints, and quality standard.

00:00:05.257 --> 00:00:08.088
Only the fictional approved facts are supplied.

00:00:08.088 --> 00:00:12.132
The team reviews a complete request within two business days.

00:00:12.132 --> 00:00:16.580
It does not guarantee a finished estimate or a booked appointment.

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:21.028
We require questions about missing facts and a plain, respectful voice.
